  "description": "The Syncfusion® WPF SfSmartComponents provides intelligent, AI‑assisted UI controls for WPF applications, including SmartTextEditor, SmartDataGrid and more. These smart components enhance productivity with features such as real‑time text suggestions, context-aware predictions, and intelligent data interactions. Designed with a modern interface and full customization options, the SmartComponents package helps developers build faster, smarter, and more user‑friendly WPF applications.",
